{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31045","headline":"秋日将离滑台酬所知二首 二 · 薛能","name":"秋日将离滑台酬所知二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灯涩秋光静不眠，叶声身影客窗前。\n闲园露湿鸣蛩夜，急雨风吹落木天。\n城见远山应北岳，野多空地本南燕。\n明朝欲别忘形处，愁把离杯听管弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}